%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontSize": "24px", "sequenceNumberFontSize": "22px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant PowerCtrl as Power Controller
    participant SensorMCU as Sensor MCU
    participant TagIC as Tag IC
    participant RFReader as Edge RF Reader
    participant Hub as Edge Gateway (Raspberry Pi + Sensors)
    participant PicoLTE as PicoLTE Modem
    participant Cloud as Cloud / Server

    Note over PowerCtrl,Hub: System power cycle
    PowerCtrl->>Hub: 0. Supply power (hourly wake cycle)
    Hub->>Hub: Boot OS and initialize services

    Note over SensorMCU,TagIC: Sensor Node operations
    RFReader->>TagIC: 1. RF Poll (CW + Gen2)
    TagIC-->>RFReader: 2. Respond (EPC + payload)
    RFReader->>SensorMCU: 3. Wake MCU (timed signal)
    SensorMCU->>SensorMCU: 4. Power sensors, init ADC
    SensorMCU->>SensorMCU: 5. Sample temp, moisture, cond
    SensorMCU->>SensorMCU: 6. Process and format data
    SensorMCU->>TagIC: 7. Write user memory (I2C)
    SensorMCU-->>SensorMCU: 8. Enter standby

    Note over RFReader,Hub: Edge Gateway collects and buffers data
    RFReader->>Hub: 9. Return tag records
    Hub->>Hub: 10. Read local sensors
    Hub->>Hub: 11. Buffer parsed records (SQLite)
    Hub->>Hub: 12. Retry/backoff if network unavailable

    Note over Hub,Cloud: Data transmission (WiFi primary, LTE fallback)
    Hub->>Cloud: 13. HTTP POST via WiFi
    alt WiFi success
        Cloud-->>Hub: 14. 200 OK {ingest_id, received_ts}
    else WiFi unavailable
        Hub->>PicoLTE: 15. Initialize LTE connection
        PicoLTE->>Cloud: 16. HTTP POST via LTE
        Cloud-->>PicoLTE: 17. 200 OK
        PicoLTE-->>Hub: 18. Forward response
    end
    Cloud->>Cloud: 19. Validate key & store in TimescaleDB
    Cloud->>Cloud: 20. Serve latest(device_id) to Web UI

    Note over Hub,PowerCtrl: Power management and shutdown
    Hub->>RFReader: 21. Power down reader
    Hub->>SensorMCU: 22. Sleep / standby
    Hub->>PicoLTE: 23. Modem sleep
    Hub->>Hub: 24. Shutdown sequence complete
    Hub->>PowerCtrl: 25. Signal job complete
    PowerCtrl-->>Hub: 26. Cut power until next cycle